<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54471" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταμαντ-εύομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>foretell against</i> or <i>about</i> one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι τῶν ἐχθρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					4.4.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">&lt;αὐτὸσ&gt; αὑτοῦ
				σιωπὴν κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				15.686c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτο τῇ πόλει</span>, c.
				fut.
			inf., <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Pun.</u>
				77
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>divine, surmise</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν προγεγονότων τὰ μέλλοντα
					-μαντευόμενοι κρίνομεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1368a31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὸ μέλλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2
				</span></i>
			. <i><span class="en">
				22.7
			</span></i>, etc.: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰητροῦ ἐστι -μαντεύσασθαι τῶν τοιούτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τῆς τῶν ποιημάτων διανοίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					14.634d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ εἰκότως συμβαίνοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>in CA</u>
					10p.437M.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. περὶ τῶν γυναικῶν, ὁποῖαι . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nicostr.
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.22.102
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.907
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					36.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
